{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56560","headline":"火记歌（幷序） 二 · 韩蕴中","name":"火记歌（幷序） 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"二九临鑪日，乾坤气正交。\n金童来克木，土镇水胎胞。\n感应相吞噉，和同在意调。\n进时加刻漏，退即卦依爻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩蕴中","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56560.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56560","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}